## It measures interest, not importance
Google Trends shows how much people are searching for a topic compared with usual. A sudden jump means attention, not necessarily news value or truth.

## Spikes are short
Most trending topics rise and fall within a day or two. That is why the best explainers answer the question people are actually asking, quickly and clearly.

## What to watch
Treat a trend as a starting point. Check what reliable sources say before you share anything.
